===Notes===
*Despite the in-game description, a shield’s damage resistances don't apply the advertised 50% bonus to block value.
*{{t|Eternal Guard}} prevents blocking from ending at the start of your next turn and allows Counterstrike to affect multiple enemies.
*Shield effects that trigger on blocking are checked for each blocked damage hit, including partial blocks. Individual effects may have their own chance or once-per-turn limit.
**For example, [[Coral Spray]] has a 30% chance per blocked damage hit to spray freezing water towards the attacker.